admin-delete-user-title = Delete this account?
admin-delete-user-explain = Deactivating only suspends an account: the person can't sign in, and reactivating restores everything. Deleting is final: your app signs their removal from every channel, then their devices, keys and memberships are removed and their sign-in is released, so signing in again creates a new, empty account.
